<title>USA: Innovative Tech opens Canadian headquarter.</title>
<headline>Innovative Tech opens Canadian headquarter.</headline>
<dateline>WARMINSTER, Pa. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innovative Tech Systems Inc said Friday it has opened its new Canadian headquarters in Winnipeg, Manitoba, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company said it opened the office because of its growing Canadian client base, which includes the CIBC Development Corporation, Manitoba Telecom Services Inc, the Municipality of Metropolitan Toronto and Petro-Canada.</p>
<p>Innovate Tech provides facilities automation software and data collection systems.</p>
</text>
